          "items": [
            "Pinkie Flamingo Welcomes You To Pray For Sun!<br>King / King / Queen / Full Bunks<br><br>Pinkie Flamingo glanced up at the magnificent Summer sky. Small puffy white clouds dotted the brilliant blue backdrop and the sun shown radiantly… warming the soul of the morning as she made her way along 30A to check out her newest guest nest…Pray For Sun. Fortunately, this is a prayer that is answered more often than not here in the Sunshine State. Averaging 255 days of sun a year, Florida is a top destination for sun worshippers. As both a Leo and a native Floridan, Pinkie had her own motto…”A day without sunshine is a like day without orange juice.”<br><br>Take the perfect combination of the classic “old Florida” vibe and the “up and coming” energy of a new community and you have described Inlet Beach.<br>Nestled between Lake Powell and the Gulf of Mexico lies your new favorite vacation destination. Appealing to many for it's more laid back and carefree mood, the area of Inlet Beach joins the all-star line-up of 30A Beaches but still retains its quaint charm and quiet, unhurried pace.<br><br>With all of the excitement of Panama City Beach to the East, Destin and its marvelous tourist appeal to the West, and the charm and natural beauty of 30A just minutes away, the location could not be better. Enjoy even more shopping, dining and attractions at nearby popular areas like Rosemary Beach and Pier Park. Bike or walk to nearby Inlet Beach public access point and on out onto the gorgeous sugary white sand of the Gulf beach with its sparkling Emerald green water and fresh salty breezes.<br><br>Pray For Sun Home Highlights<br>•\tPet~Friendly<br>•\t2 King Bedrooms<br>•\t3 Levels<br>•\tMultiple Balconies<br>•\tOutdoor Dining<br>•\tPropane Grill<br>•. 4 Adult Bikes / 2 Kid Bikes<br>•\tCommunity Pool<br>•\tNew Pedestrian Tunnel to Inlet Beach Public Access<br><br>Endless recreational and entertainment opportunities are all within easy grasp with the area's largest beach access and Camp Helena State Park mere minutes away. Visitors delight in discovering the boutiques, trendy shops and popular restaurants in the fashionable #30Avenue Shopping Center...just minutes from this vacation home.<br><br>Shopping, Dining & Entertainment<br>•\t1) Seaside – 10 miles<br>•\t2) Alys Beach – 1.8 miles<br>•\t3) Rosemary Beach – 1 mile<br>•\t5) Shades Bar & Grill – 0.4 mile<br>•\t6) 30Avenue – 500 ft<br>•\t10) Publix Shopping Center – 3 miles<br>•\t11) Winn-Dixie and CVS Pharmacy – 3 miles<br>•\t12) Pier Park – 10 miles<br><br>Outdoors & Sports<br>•\t4) Public Beach Access – 0.7 mile<br>•\t7) Pedestrian Underpass on Hwy 98 – 0.3 mile<br>•\t8) Camp Helen State Park – 1.8 miles<br>•\t9) Lake Powell Park with boat launch and swimming area – 2 blocks<br><br>Makin My Way Along 30A…Inlet Beach<br><br>All of Pinkie's Properties Have A Few Things In Common<br>•\tMust Be 25 To Book<br>•\tNo Smoking <br>•\tCancellation OK 30 Days Prior To Check-In<br>•\tSheets & Bath Towels Included…BYO Beach Towels<br>•\tAll Kitchens Fully-Equipped With Cooking/Eating Utensils… BYO Spices & Food<br>•\tBasic Essentials Starter Set Only…TP, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Soaps, Etc …Depending on Length of Stay You May Need More",
