        "rating": 10,
        "text": "It’s great beautiful clean new house and we totally enjoy it. They have everything you need, the family enjoyed the 30A puzzle a lot and lots of games and cards for you to play, just bring one extra paper towel and trash bags. Other than everything is there including wash detergent for laundry. The community pool is small but clean Please change the distance to Rosemary beach, it’s not 8 min walk, should be 8 min drive. I primarily booked it because it’s walkable to Rosemary beach, it’s 25 minute walk to Rosemary.",
